    "body": "As far as in-code testing goes, I don't think there's a way to test it with our in-code tests either. Code coverage metrics are not a hard blocker to merging for us, so that's not that important.\r\n\r\nI'm of half a mind to move the notification feature to its own module in v2.0.0, just so that we can cleanly separate the code that is functionally untestable (the stuff with notifications) from the duration stuff, which should be 100% testable, but that's not for this PR.",
